  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二十一关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "This is the last wave of pursuers!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "...Aaargh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "All clear!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "Confirming that it's safe over here!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "Where's the enemy commander?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "...Not with their main force."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "The enemy is lurking... we're being followed and watched."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "Are they trying to wear us down until they have the perfect opportunity to strike?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Reunion is no stranger to sneak attacks."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "We learned this the hard way at Chernobog."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Let's fall back quickly..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "I can't guarantee the safety of the escape route."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "We'll be in danger if they start demolishing the nearby buildings to block the road."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Hurry, let's see what other routes we can take. The stealthier, the better!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "Amiya, how about taking that staircase to our 4 o'clock down?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "That's a difficult route."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Aaargh! Rhodes Island!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "It's an ambush! Watch out!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "Continue the chase."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "Don't give them any room to breathe."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "Madam..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "There are some Infected kids... still in the slums."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "If possible..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "I hope that you can take care of them..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Our duty is to protect Lungmen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "The Infected are not considered citizens of Lungmen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "However, citizens or not, the Infected still belong to Lungmen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "I have no obligation to promise you anything, but I will perform my duty."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "After all..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "They said they used to..."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "="
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "It's something we've always been doing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "Thank you..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Do you know why we've been searching for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "...I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "I can't think of any reason why you'd want me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "But I have a feeling..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "That this isn't about me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "...It's about my parents."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "...Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Your father was the most famous scientist in Chernobog."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "As well as one of the most important political figures there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Perhaps, there's something you might know..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "But even if that isn't the case..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "We cannot allow you to fall into Reunion's hands."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "Hehe. I've found you, L.G.D."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "Don't take this personally..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "But I have a very interesting plot in my hands."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "To make things more entertaining, I'll need you all to participate."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "Now, let us begin."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
